id: flash-fullscreen
section: Flash
item: Full screen is entered and left by the finger on the movie's own button; the system's turn to landscape is the same as the stock browser's, which the accelerometer turns back
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-instr-features.swf&vars=fs=1
kit: cavekit-flash.md R4
fixture: portrait-after
wait text ready features 30
wait text kid "kid w=" 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
wait text fs "fs fullScreen" 15
shoot fullscreen
dismiss 384 400
wait text fs "fs normal" 15
pause 3000
dismiss 384 400
wait text fs "fs fullScreen" 15
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&bg=00ff00
wait text ready stage= 30
expect flash-behind 100,500,700,900 00ff00 yes
